* Tendermint BFT Consensus
** Motivation
*** WAN, many nodes, mutual distrust
*** Gossip instead of direct links
*** No proof piggybacked on proposals
** Model
*** Voting power, n > 3f
*** Partial synchrony, GST, Δ
*** Gossip communication property
** Consensus problem
*** One instance per height
*** Agreement, Termination, Validity
*** valid() predicate
** Round
*** PROPOSAL carries the block
*** PREVOTE id(v) or nil
*** PRECOMMIT after 2f+1 prevotes
*** Decide on 2f+1 precommits
left side
** Safety
*** Lock on precommit
*** Lemma 1: quorum intersection
*** Lemma 2-3: Agreement
** Termination
*** validValue / validRound
*** Re-propose latest possible decision
*** Timeouts grow > 2Δ
*** Round skip on f+1
** Comparison
*** PBFT: same pattern, no view change
*** HotStuff: 3 steps, responsive
*** CometBFT, Malachite
@endmindmap
